The '''Astro Soldier Toilet''' is an released toilet that was added in the [[Episode 76 Part 1 Update]]. He acts like the [[Glitch Toilet]] but even stronger.

== Appearance ==
The Astro Soldier Toilet is a black toilet, with a helmet equipped with a visor. It has a huge orange laser on the front, and two smaller lasers on the sides of the big one. It could possibly have a jetpack on its back.

